  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5fdcb7e1f460ab840990daed472ab196, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 023c0d2012179454994cbd8d9cc709ef, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: cda847e5049d2af469a67067a74eda7b, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 97a7c82dc23413d46b8e6985c381577f, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: a8cf42387a124d94cb088c55034340b0, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 02938696d738b6f4eb6d5c5a25bfe8f4, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa3012410fbff3340b1a4ca02a36f8df, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3c77d0a6b53689440a6c8eb942f69b8f, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54d74cb2e864ed9439b6d36def7562cb, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: e812aaf35297def439d847167c1feccf, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 42688526c1af08c4a82830dd3fc9061e, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5be4a148af1784e43a8db132ceb27caa, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6832cc917009de041862ee9824f8350b, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2353cb33b34bcb74cb3983cfab56044f, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 85af50d08896fa5479eca34e48bf951d, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0c67b9f76e30bb24197b0e670eaac8cb, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7410e5486327a24448f4d4ef0b7529c6, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: f5b4411a195f0cf4492c1fe277c3fad5, type: 3}
  texts:
  - 'Hello! This is the tutorial for Sheepy Business. If you need help contact me:
    krasizh07@gmail.com.'
  - This is your money.
  - And this is your sheep. Looks cute isn't it?
  - 'Looks like she is hungry. '
  - You can feed her by opening the inventory.
  - To feed her drag and drop the wheat onto her.
  - Don't forget to feed your sheep. If the food is at 0, the health will go down
    and eventually dissapear.
  - You can heal your sheep with the vitamins.
  - If you want easy money you can cut the sheep's wool with the shears
  - The wheat can be produced in the Farm Field
  - Here is your unlocked field.
  - To seed the wheat you need to open the inventory.
  - Drag and drop wheat seeds onto the field.
  - Now you need to wait 1 minute and 30 seconds to grow.
  - You can instantly grow it by using fertilizer.
  - Once growth you will need sickle to harvest it. Simply drag and drop it onto
    the plant.
  - If you want to expand your farm by buying more Sheep, Fields, Sickles and  etc.,
    you need to go to the Shop.
  - 'Here is the Buy section. Brown circle shows how many of that item you have and
    the gold circle is the price.

'
  - If you want to buy an item you need to press this button.
  - Press this to go to the Sell section.
  - To sell an item press this button.
  - And with that you completed the tutorial. I think you will be great farmer.
